WEBVTT

00:19:55.746 --> 00:20:00.121
What I would say is, let's say you're my
boss and you're you're a pretty armored.

00:20:00.663 --> 00:20:02.829
You're not your you don't
do vulnerability.

00:20:03.746 --> 00:20:07.913
And we just had a big disappointment
setback in our team.

00:20:08.204 --> 00:20:11.121
And, you know, your style
is to just move forward.

00:20:11.621 --> 00:20:14.829
And so what I might say, instead
of saying, you know, look,

00:20:14.829 --> 00:20:18.163
I think we need to be vulnerable and
take the armor off and, you know,

00:20:18.163 --> 00:20:22.038
really embrace this failure that's going
to get you fired or in trouble.

00:20:22.079 --> 00:20:26.871
So what I would say to this person
and depending on how they are,

00:20:26.871 --> 00:20:28.121
is I would say, hey, Adam.

00:20:29.204 --> 00:20:30.204
I have a question for you.